<img src="img/sameei015_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td><a href="#3">
<img src="img/sameei001_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td><a href="#4">
<img src="img/sameei018_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td>
